    "body": "It's not clear exactly what this issue is about, or how it's related to the contents of the HTML Standard. In particular \"Instead of going the roundabout way of recreating inputs with other elements, CSS, and Javascript\", as well as the screenshots, makes it sound like this is meant to reply to some blog post that I haven't read.\r\n\r\nI'll close this, as it doesn't seem to be a bug report for the HTML Standard, but if there is some relationship I've missed, please let me know.",
